NIST SRD 46 data
---------------

The databases contain or derive from NIST Standard Reference Database 46,
Critically Selected Stability Constants of Metal Complexes, Version 8.0
(2004), National Institute of Standards and Technology:
https://doi.org/10.18434/M32154
https://www.nist.gov/srd/nist46

This project acknowledges NIST as the source of the SRD 46 data. The source
database credits R. M. Smith and A. E. Martell for data collection and
selection, and R. J. Motekaitis for the original program. Retain the source
scientific references when using individual constants.

The official SRD 46 archive README expressly permits modification,
